---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout active="about">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm Roki. I like building things, taking them apart, and keeping notes on
      what I learn along the way — which is exactly what this site is for.
    </p>
    <!-- TODO: swap in 1–2 sentences about what you actually do: role, stack, where you're based. -->
    <p>
      These days I spend most of my time on <strong>what I'm currently
      learning</strong>, and whatever's worth writing about ends up under
      <a href="/writing/">Writing</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      If something I wrote turns out to be wrong, the fix usually becomes the
      next post. That's the whole system.
    </p>
    <p>
      The fastest way to reach me is <a href={site.social.email}>email</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
